# Implementation of Secure Cloud Infrastructure Using Microsoft Azure

## 📌 Project Overview

This project demonstrates the implementation of a **Secure Cloud Infrastructure** for a small company using **Microsoft Azure**. The objective is to provide a scalable, secure, and cost-effective cloud environment by utilizing various Azure services.

Traditional on-premises infrastructure requires significant investment in physical hardware and maintenance. Microsoft Azure offers cloud-based solutions that improve scalability, security, resource management, and remote accessibility.

This project was developed as part of the **INT327 - Cloud Infrastructure and Resource Management** course.

---

## 🎯 Objectives

* Implement secure cloud resource management.
* Provide centralized file storage.
* Configure secure networking.
* Manage user access using Role-Based Access Control (RBAC).
* Build a scalable cloud infrastructure for small businesses.

---

## ☁️ Azure Services Used

* Azure Resource Group
* Azure Virtual Machine (VM)
* Azure Storage Account
* Azure Blob Storage
* Azure Virtual Network (VNet)
* Azure Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)

---

